"""Turn baked material maps into Unity Texture2D payloads (raw mip chains, BC compressed).

    python own_textures.py atlas <bake_dir> <tag> <slots_json> <size> <out_dir> [<name_prefix>] [<extra_json>]
    python own_textures.py single <bake_dir> <tag> <out_dir> [<name_prefix>]

atlas : UDIM tiles of <tag> (from blender/bake_material_maps.py) placed into a size x size atlas, slot (sx, sy) =
        quadrant [sx/2, sy/2] in UV space (same packing as own_body.py uv0).
single: one tile (1001) at its baked size.
Outputs per map: <name>.bin (all mips, largest first, Unity row order = bottom row first) + <name>.json
  color  -> BC7  (TextureFormat 25), sRGB, alpha = baked alpha if present else 255
  normal -> DXT5nm in BC3 (TextureFormat 12): R=255, G=y, B=0, A=x (Unity UnpackNormal RG-or-AG), mips renormalised
  smooth -> BC3 grayscale in RGBA (smoothness = 1 - baked roughness), linear
  emit   -> BC7 sRGB (only written when any texel is lit)
etcpak takes RGBA input (verified with texture2ddecoder round-trips).
Padding (2026-10-18, default on, TFA_NO_PAD=1 disables): every baked tile is filled outside its UV islands by a
push-pull pyramid from the island texels (coverage = any pass differs from Blender's bake background: black colour/
roughness/emission/alpha, flat normal). Unpadded bakes carried
black albedo + roughness 0 (= smoothness 1, a mirror) + junk normals around every island; bilinear filtering and the mips
pulled that into every seam -> jagged bright edges at the lips/chin and cracked streaks along the vulva slit (m19c).
Quality (opt-in, 2026-10-19 body fidelity): TFA_NORMAL_BC5=1 writes normal maps as BC5 (TextureFormat 27, R = x,
G = y: the 6-bit/4-level G channel of DXT5nm banded the relief), TFA_COLOR_BC7=1 keeps BC7 colour under
TFA_OFFICIAL_FORMATS.
Budget (opt-in): TFA_CAPS="MainTex=2048,BumpMap=1024,*=2048" caps sizes (drops top mips), TFA_OFFICIAL_FORMATS=1 =
DXT1 opaque colour/smoothness/spec, DXT5 alpha colour/normals/transparency (formats of the official characters),
TFA_NORMAL_DX=1 writes the normal map Y flipped (DirectX convention of the official maps), TFA_SCALAR_BC4=1 writes SmoothnessMap / SpecGlossMap /
MetallicGlossMap as BC4 (TextureFormat 26, R only, 4 bpp; Unified reads .r - texture plan 2026-10-25), TFA_CONST_4X4=1 stores a
constant map (every channel's range <= 2) as its 4x4 mip only, TFA_EMIT_TO_ALBEDO=<gain> adds the emission bake
to the colour (linear; Unified has no emission slot: LEDs, eye glow).
Alpha (2026-10-18, TFA_NO_ALPHA_FIX=1 disables): colour dilated under texels below the cutoff (TFA_ALPHA_CUTOFF, default
0.5; hair 0.27) and coverage-preserving alpha mips in _MainTex.a and _TransparencyMap (REVIEW D19 aliased lashes/brows).
